==Resources==
* TOC: <code>120100</code>
* Official patch notes: [https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24293281/curse-of-ulatek-content-update-notes#item21 Curse of Ula'tek Content Update Notes]
* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/12.0.7..12.1.0 wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/compare/12.0.7...12.1.0 BlizzardInterfaceResources]

===Notes===
* Added {{api|t=i|AuraContainer}} and {{api|t=i|AuraButton}} intrinsic frames.
* SVG textures are now supported with the {{api|t=o|VectorGraphics}} object type.
* {{api|UIParentLoadAddOn}} has been moved to {{tlygo|LoadAddOnWithErrorHandling}}.
* {{api|MouseIsOver}} has been moved to {{tlygo|InputUtil.IsMouseOver}}.
* {{tlygo|build=12.0.7|CanAccessObject}} has been replaced with {{api|t=w|FrameScriptObject:CanBeAccessedInContext}}.
* Deprecated {{api|getglobal}} and {{api|setglobal}}.
* The Auto Loot setting (CVar {{api|t=c|autoLootDefault}}) is now account wide.
* New UI texture filenames will no longer be published to the {{dbc|ManifestInterfaceData}} DB. Existing filenames will remain available, and this change will not affect players. Addons will still be able to use these textures.

