{{apisummary.heading|Preview of PTR 7}}
* A number of Unit APIs are being changed to return secret values when the unit's identity is secret. This is being done to prevent various methods of combining these API calls to compare secret units to each other in combat.
** APIs affected: {{api|UnitClass}}, {{api|UnitClassBase}}, {{api|UnitIsOwnerOrControllerOfUnit}}, {{api|UnitSex}}, {{api|UnitSexBase}}, {{api|UnitPhaseReason}}, {{api|UnitGroupRolesAssigned}}, {{api|UnitGroupRolesAssignedEnum}}, {{api|UnitIsRaidOfficer}}, {{api|UnitInRaid}}, {{api|UnitIsPVP}}, {{api|UnitRace}}, {{api|UnitIsGroupLeader}}, {{api|UnitIsGroupAssistant}}, {{api|UnitLeadsAnyGroup}}, {{api|UnitGetAvailableRoles}}, {{api|GetInspectSpecialization}}.
* The {{api|GetGuildInfo}} API is being changed to no longer accept compound unit tokens.
* The following APIs are being changed to return secret values when auras are secret: {{api|UnitIsCharmed}}, {{api|UnitIsPossessed}}.

